repository-code: https://github.com/0thernes/hoggar-bound-lab
url: https://0thernes.github.io/hoggar-bound-lab/
abstract: A combined study of spectral bounds and their information limits in Pauli contextuality. It
  integrates a Lean 4 formalization of the previously known spectral floor, configurations attaining exact
  degrees 75 and 480 with finite Lean certificates, seven-qubit results using external exact counts, and
  an explicit four-qubit C3 pair with identical carrier spectra and unequal completion spectra. The C3
  completion cubic traces are 14976 and 15360. The manuscript distinguishes kernel-checked statements,
  separate algebraic results, executable counts, prior work, and unresolved questions.
keywords:
- quantum contextuality
- Pauli group
- symplectic polar space
- Kochen-Specker theorem
- Clifford hierarchy
- bent functions
- Lean 4
- formal verification
- spectral invariants
- cospectrality
- Pauli completion
